Dear Millburn Families,
Good morning! We hope this message finds you well.
We wanted to share an update regarding our school calendar for this month.
Our *Professional Development Day previously scheduled for Thursday, July
30, 2026, has been canceled*, and the school will now be *open for regular
operating hours*.
With the upcoming changes to our 2026=E2=80=932027 calendar, we felt it was
important to provide families with a full work week, especially after the
recent holidays and scheduled closures that resulted in several shortened
weeks.
We appreciate your continued trust, support, and partnership, and we hope
this adjustment helps make your schedules a little easier.
If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to reach out.
Best,
Millburn Administration Team





